General Fu has been captured by the Russians! We must recapture him as quickly as possible! Intelligence reports that he is to be moved from a Russian base to one of their launch facilities - intercept the convoy carrying him and retake the General. You will first need to reactivate six abandoned artillery units spread around the area from a training exercise. Further orders will be given in the field.

MISSION OBJECTIVES:
- Recapture General Fu from the hands of the Russians.

INTELLIGENCE REPORT:
The Russians will be using standard prisoner transportation procedures - there will be three convoys, two of which will be decoys to put us off the scent. You will need to determine which one is carrying the General, and concentrate all your forces on that one.

ENGINEERING REPORT:
You have under your command a modified Minelayer which will operate as a Mobile Repair Unit, dropping repair packs rather than Prox Mines. We strongly suggest you use this to repair the artillery, as armouries are notoriously inaccurate over long distances.
